WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.490
=Episode 6=

01:08.490 --> 01:11.740
(Tinglan Palace)

01:16.160 --> 01:16.880
Handan,

01:16.880 --> 01:17.880
what took you so long?

01:18.120 --> 01:19.160
Did you get the medicine?

01:19.440 --> 01:20.520
Hurry and apply it for me.

01:29.920 --> 01:30.680
Why are you hiding?

01:30.700 --> 01:32.560
Didn't you want to
learn the art of seduction?

01:33.360 --> 01:34.600
I will teach you right now.

01:35.560 --> 01:37.400
(Why would he
suddenly reveal his identity?)

01:40.520 --> 01:41.280
Attendant Li,

01:41.400 --> 01:42.840
what nonsense are you talking about?

01:42.880 --> 01:44.320
Is this part of the lesson too?

01:44.520 --> 01:45.280
Black Zhen Liquor

01:45.640 --> 01:46.920
can make people tell the truth.

01:47.880 --> 01:49.160
You knew who I was all along,

01:49.280 --> 01:50.520
and yet you're still pretending.

01:52.880 --> 01:54.400
(He has been drugged.)

01:58.600 --> 01:59.960
(What did I say?)

02:00.120 --> 02:01.390
(How much does he actually know?)

02:01.600 --> 02:02.160
Your Majesty,

02:02.560 --> 02:04.320
you should summon
the imperial physician now

02:04.360 --> 02:05.640
to avoid any harm to your health.

02:08.400 --> 02:09.800
Don't you want my favor?

02:10.840 --> 02:11.760
You on top,

02:12.360 --> 02:13.440
and I below.

02:14.280 --> 02:15.400
What's the matter?

02:16.200 --> 02:17.400
Are you afraid now?

02:17.840 --> 02:18.840
Your Majesty is mistaken.

02:19.600 --> 02:21.280
I want the heart of a powerful figure

02:21.360 --> 02:22.120
who is decisive

02:22.120 --> 02:23.000
and stands above all,

02:23.920 --> 02:25.960
not a heart controlled by drugs.

02:33.200 --> 02:34.840
Shen Zhinian,

02:35.960 --> 02:37.200
you...

02:38.960 --> 02:40.200
Very well.

02:45.320 --> 02:47.440
(He didn't get angry
at my deception and refusal.)

02:47.960 --> 02:49.160
(It seems this risky move)

02:49.440 --> 02:50.680
(was the right one.)

03:01.520 --> 03:03.440
(Shen Zhinian,)

03:04.280 --> 03:06.680
(playing hard to get with me, are you?)

03:07.040 --> 03:08.840
(Just you wait.)

03:12.640 --> 03:14.160
Young Lady, please stop playing.

03:14.400 --> 03:15.760
Aren't you afraid?

03:15.760 --> 03:18.320
Why would a snake
suddenly appear on your bed?

03:18.640 --> 03:20.080
Fortunately, you weren't bitten.

03:20.240 --> 03:21.680
This is just too dangerous.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.360
Look at this snake.

03:25.480 --> 03:26.480
It's quite interesting.

03:27.240 --> 03:29.120
As soon as I reach out,
it crawls into my hand.

03:29.520 --> 03:30.440
If I don't let it up,

03:30.520 --> 03:31.840
it even hangs its head

03:32.120 --> 03:33.360
as if it's feeling sad.

03:33.920 --> 03:35.600
The Emperor has arrived!

03:35.960 --> 03:36.720
(Oh no.)

03:37.040 --> 03:38.360
(He's here to settle the score?)

03:47.680 --> 03:48.800
Your Majesty

03:49.040 --> 03:50.480
is here to hold me accountable?

03:51.520 --> 03:52.920
You should know very well

03:53.240 --> 03:54.720
what I'm here for.

03:55.280 --> 03:56.320
I am dull-witted

03:56.340 --> 03:57.720
and do not know your intentions.

03:57.840 --> 04:00.160
If you, who could pretend
not to know me to get close,

04:00.400 --> 04:01.400
are dull-witted,

04:01.760 --> 04:03.640
then there is no
clever person in this palace.

04:04.320 --> 04:06.680
I was indeed looking for Attendant Li.

04:06.840 --> 04:08.840
I just didn't expect
Your Majesty to be there.

04:09.640 --> 04:10.520
I was afraid,

04:10.520 --> 04:11.840
so I could only play along

04:12.040 --> 04:12.880
and continue the act

04:13.040 --> 04:13.800
with Your Majesty.

04:16.480 --> 04:18.080
You actually know how to be afraid, huh?

04:21.300 --> 04:22.400
Your Majesty, you can't read!

04:22.600 --> 04:23.640
This is a book for women.

04:24.080 --> 04:25.180
- How bold.
- Your Majesty.

04:28.000 --> 04:29.520
I insist on taking a look.

04:35.380 --> 04:35.860
(Fishing Alone on the Autumn River)

04:35.860 --> 04:36.380
(Cold waves shimmer
in the autumn light.)

04:36.380 --> 04:36.860
(A lone fisherman
in a straw cloak angles in the sunset.)

04:36.860 --> 04:37.500
(Drunk, lying among reed flowers
with wind-filled sleeves.)

04:37.500 --> 04:38.020
(Waking to the setting moon
and a boat covered in frost.)

04:39.120 --> 04:40.120
Go back.

04:42.940 --> 04:45.740
(Investigation Records
of Nangong Xuanyu)

04:51.360 --> 04:53.320
You've investigated thoroughly,
haven't you?

04:58.520 --> 04:59.400
Why are you hiding?

05:00.760 --> 05:02.120
Now, you're scared?

05:08.080 --> 05:09.280
I entered the palace

05:09.400 --> 05:10.800
solely for Your Majesty.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.400
Investigating you

05:13.000 --> 05:15.040
was also because
I wanted to win your favor.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.040
How did you find out?

05:17.640 --> 05:18.960
When I entered the palace,

05:18.960 --> 05:20.840
my father gave me 300 taels of silver.

05:21.480 --> 05:23.240
To investigate
Your Majesty's preferences,

05:23.560 --> 05:24.720
I have spent them all.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.120
Liar.

05:34.240 --> 05:36.520
So it was you who stole
my little white snake.

05:36.920 --> 05:37.760
Speak.

05:38.000 --> 05:39.120
Who put you up to this?

05:39.800 --> 05:40.920
No one put me up to it.

05:41.160 --> 05:42.280
It came here on its own.

05:42.880 --> 05:44.800
It suddenly appeared
on my bed last night.

05:45.080 --> 05:46.320
I couldn't get it to leave.

05:46.440 --> 05:47.640
I didn't know it was yours.

05:47.800 --> 05:48.680
Shen Zhinian,

05:49.880 --> 05:51.880
if I don't get my
little white snake back,

05:52.160 --> 05:53.520
I will sentence you to death.

05:56.080 --> 05:56.800
Yes, Your Majesty.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.000
Where are you?

06:07.520 --> 06:08.560
Come out quickly.

06:08.920 --> 06:10.360
Your master is here.

06:10.480 --> 06:12.240
Two hours have already passed.

06:12.600 --> 06:13.720
If you still can't find it,

06:13.920 --> 06:16.200
beware that I will sentence you
to death by white silk.

06:20.040 --> 06:20.960
Do you like this?

06:21.120 --> 06:22.000
Come out.

06:22.200 --> 06:23.240
I'll give it to you.

06:23.640 --> 06:24.720
You don't actually think

06:24.900 --> 06:26.080
it will listen to you, do you?

06:28.360 --> 06:29.360
It's coming out.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.520
(Nangong Xuanyu,)

06:44.200 --> 06:46.360
(I'm not only going to
make your snake obey me,)

06:46.780 --> 06:48.400
(but I'm also going
to make you obey me.)

06:48.800 --> 06:50.760
(You really have
many tricks up your sleeve.)

06:51.680 --> 06:53.400
(I have no time to
play with you anymore.)

06:54.540 --> 06:55.120
Your Majesty.

06:59.680 --> 07:01.080
I've been kneeling for so long,

07:02.480 --> 07:03.560
I can't stand up.

07:04.480 --> 07:05.520
Could you

07:06.160 --> 07:07.360
give me a hand?

07:07.950 --> 07:11.820
♪Faint rouge hides
the tenderness in the eyes♪

07:11.820 --> 07:15.380
♪Every step is treacherous,
regardless of the world♪

07:15.380 --> 07:19.050
♪Flowers wither easily,
but obsession remains♪

07:21.720 --> 07:24.080
(They say emperors
have always been heartless.)

07:24.720 --> 07:26.160
(Nangong Xuanyu,)

07:26.600 --> 07:28.240
(you are no exception.)

07:28.240 --> 07:31.780
♪Time silently scars those left behind♪

07:31.780 --> 07:35.570
♪I walk through the palace
day and night, just for my beloved♪

07:35.570 --> 07:38.700
♪All my tenderness is for you,
I'd stay alone for you♪

07:38.890 --> 07:42.300
♪I don't ask for equality,
only that you hear me♪

07:42.300 --> 07:45.490
♪Years of longing haunt
the palace gates, too deep to hide♪

07:45.490 --> 07:49.030
♪I endured the years,
guarding a single truth♪

07:49.240 --> 07:52.500
♪Spending my youth on deep love,
asking not of right or wrong♪

07:54.360 --> 07:56.280
(Met you first under the moonlight,)

07:56.600 --> 07:59.000
(and my heart began to race.)

07:59.600 --> 08:01.200
(I only wish that when the dream ends,)

08:01.400 --> 08:03.000
(you will still be here.)

08:04.000 --> 08:05.520
(Warmth behind the red curtains,)

08:06.640 --> 08:07.920
(entwined with you.)

08:09.480 --> 08:10.760
(Nangong Xuanyu,)

08:11.720 --> 08:12.640
(your heart)

08:13.200 --> 08:14.520
(is racing for me.)

08:14.600 --> 08:15.520
Your Majesty.

08:16.740 --> 08:17.320
Your Majesty.

08:17.600 --> 08:18.360
What is it?

08:18.400 --> 08:19.440
Dowager Consort Liu encountered

08:19.440 --> 08:21.230
bandits on her way
back from Nanhua Temple.

08:21.240 --> 08:23.390
Fortunately, she was saved by
scholars traveling for the exams.

08:23.400 --> 08:24.590
She will return to
the palace tomorrow morning.

08:24.600 --> 08:26.320
Will you go to
the palace gate to receive her?

08:26.640 --> 08:28.360
This dynasty is ruled by filial piety.

08:28.920 --> 08:29.840
If I don't go,

08:30.400 --> 08:32.000
Jiang Chen will nag me about it again.

08:33.840 --> 08:35.160
(He mentioned Jiang Chen.)

08:36.040 --> 08:38.580
(I didn't expect that he and Jiang Chen
were on such good terms.)

08:39.600 --> 08:41.280
Your Majesty is not
looking for the snake?

08:43.000 --> 08:44.160
I don't need to look for it.

08:45.360 --> 08:46.720
It will return on its own.

08:51.040 --> 08:52.480
If it dares to run away again,

08:53.720 --> 08:54.640
I'll stew it.

08:59.560 --> 09:00.880
Your Majesty is formidable.

09:01.160 --> 09:02.440
It wouldn't dare run away again.

09:02.800 --> 09:04.080
Regarding the little white snake,

09:04.180 --> 09:05.440
do not speak of it to anyone.

09:05.640 --> 09:06.400
Yes, Your Majesty.

09:07.160 --> 09:08.200
Shen Zhinian,

09:08.680 --> 09:09.840
tomorrow, follow me

09:10.210 --> 09:11.640
to welcome the Dowager Consort back.

09:12.310 --> 09:13.520
I obey Your Majesty's command.

09:19.600 --> 09:21.160
The white snake is finally back.

09:21.880 --> 09:23.720
This snake was born
on the peak of Mount Tian.

09:23.920 --> 09:25.960
It takes a century
to grow as thick as a thumb.

09:26.560 --> 09:29.360
Without it, when the poison
acts up on the full moon,

09:29.520 --> 09:30.960
Your Majesty could never survive it.

09:33.660 --> 09:35.800
Your Majesty was so intimate
with Shen Zhinian today,

09:36.000 --> 09:37.040
and you're letting her follow you

09:37.040 --> 09:38.700
to welcome Dowager Consort Liu tomorrow.

09:38.710 --> 09:40.080
Does this mean you trust her now?

09:40.960 --> 09:42.240
I just feel

09:42.560 --> 09:44.280
that being near her helps alleviate

09:44.280 --> 09:45.400
this scorching pain.

09:46.440 --> 09:49.080
Besides, no matter whose side she's on
or what her goal is,

09:50.560 --> 09:52.720
in the end,
she'll be just like this snake,

09:53.240 --> 09:55.000
staying obediently
in the palm of my hand.

09:56.720 --> 09:59.320
The Dowager Consort
has returned to the palace!

09:59.800 --> 10:01.280
Mount Nanhua has always been peaceful.

10:01.960 --> 10:03.600
How could you encounter bandits there?

10:04.160 --> 10:05.400
Your Majesty may not know,

10:05.600 --> 10:06.640
but this group of bandits

10:06.920 --> 10:09.040
(Dowager Consort Liu, Empress Dowager of Daliang)
used a four-year-old child to get close to me.

10:09.200 --> 10:11.200
Fortunately, two passing heroes
came to my rescue.

10:11.560 --> 10:13.960
That is how I was able to return safely.

10:14.320 --> 10:15.080
Guards,

10:15.280 --> 10:17.040
please invite the two heroes
into the hall.

10:26.300 --> 10:27.920
(Shen Nanqiao, legitimate
daughter of the Shen family in Chizhou)

10:27.920 --> 10:29.040
(Lu Jianglin, husband of Shen Nanqiao)
Shen Zhinian,

10:29.320 --> 10:30.720
you must seize

10:31.000 --> 10:32.640
this fortune.

10:32.640 --> 10:34.120
The harem

10:34.120 --> 10:35.720
is quite an eventful place.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.280
Execute!

10:42.920 --> 10:43.960
(Shen Nanqiao.)

10:44.120 --> 10:45.400
(Lu Jianglin.)

10:45.400 --> 10:47.000
(How did they get into the palace?)

10:47.000 --> 10:48.940
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

10:49.040 --> 10:49.880
You may rise.

10:50.080 --> 10:51.660
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

10:52.120 --> 10:53.480
Nanqiao and Jianglin

10:53.480 --> 10:54.840
disregarded their own safety

10:55.200 --> 10:56.440
to save me.

10:56.440 --> 10:57.720
They lured the bandits away

10:57.720 --> 10:59.000
and nearly lost their lives.

10:59.120 --> 11:01.280
Nanqiao even injured
her hand because of it.

11:01.480 --> 11:05.440
So, I brought her back
to the palace for medical treatment.

11:05.760 --> 11:08.560
(It seems Shen Nanqiao knew
the Dowager Consort would be in danger,)

11:08.840 --> 11:10.880
(so she rushed to
the rescue ahead of time)

11:10.880 --> 11:12.240
(to win her favor.)

11:12.560 --> 11:13.880
(When it comes to palace affairs,)

11:13.880 --> 11:15.580
(she is more familiar
with them than I am.)

11:15.680 --> 11:16.960
(If she manages to stay,)

11:16.960 --> 11:18.370
(she will be a huge problem for me.)

11:19.280 --> 11:21.480
Miss Shen, you also share
the surname Shen

11:22.000 --> 11:23.360
and come from Chizhou.

11:23.840 --> 11:25.200
Do you happen to know

11:25.640 --> 11:26.520
Senior Attendant Rou?

11:35.040 --> 11:35.800
Zhinian.

11:49.700 --> 11:54.820
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

11:56.540 --> 12:01.780
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

12:03.420 --> 12:05.780
♪If we don't meet♪

12:05.980 --> 12:09.220
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

12:09.420 --> 12:15.940
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

12:16.300 --> 12:22.740
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

12:23.100 --> 12:29.420
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

12:29.940 --> 12:36.620
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

12:36.620 --> 12:43.500
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

12:43.740 --> 12:49.620
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

12:50.540 --> 12:57.140
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

12:57.300 --> 13:03.980
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

13:04.260 --> 13:10.700
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
